{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029043556029-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029044641\"/><p>傷者送院救治。</p><p>青衣發生工業意外，現場在航運路36號一物流中心，今日(29日)凌晨3時41分，一名年約30歲男工人，在上址工作期間懷疑「差錯腳」，跌落約1米高地面，同事見狀代為報案。救護員到場將清醒事主送院救治。警員經調查後，案件列「工業意外有人意外受傷」，交相關部門跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T20:52:52.429036+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T20:35:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T20:51:10.683181+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T20:51:10.683181+00:00","content_hash":"d07507428a90eb1ca8d612183140a33d638d75f079bc3de372a36e7804b36e73","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}